- **Centre + lower figure (~52%) — the BODY TERRITORY survey:** the body mapped into labeled zones (back/chest oily · arms/shins dry · torso routine · flanks stretch-marks), each a dimensioned callout; the **neck + backs-of-hands lit warm-red** as the betrayal zones with the "run the line down" fix tag; the **fungal trap box** on the back as the second red; the **stretch-mark closing-window** sub-survey on the flank.
